  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is a point that lies inside a circle whose end points of diameter are <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, but&nbsp; does not lie on this diameter.<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> lies inside circle <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1,2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />But <math><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> because at <math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />points <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> &amp; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> are collinear<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1,2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>",
